{"id":3119,"slug":"3119-abstract-class-trong-python-dung-the-nao","category":"Python","subcategory":"OOP","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Abstract class trong Python — dùng thế nào?","question_en":"How are abstract classes used in Python?","answer_vi":"Dùng `ABC` + `@abstractmethod` để tạo abstract class. Class con bắt buộc implement tất cả abstract methods, nếu không sẽ không instantiate được.\n```python\nfrom abc import ABC, abstractmethod\n\nclass Repository(ABC):\n    @abstractmethod\n    async def get_by_id(self, id: int): ...\n\n    @abstractmethod\n    async def create(self, data: dict): ...\n\n    def find_all(self):          # Concrete method — có thể kế thừa\n        return self.get_all()\n\nclass UserRepository(Repository):\n    async def get_by_id(self, id): ...   # Bắt buộc implement\n    async def create(self, data): ...    # Bắt buộc implement\n\n# Repository()  # TypeError — cannot instantiate abstract class\n```","answer_en":"Use ABC + @abstractmethod. Subclasses must implement all abstract methods or they cannot be instantiated.\n```python\nfrom abc import ABC, abstractmethod\n\nclass Animal(ABC):\n    @abstractmethod\n    def speak(self) -> str: ...\n\nclass Dog(Animal):\n    def speak(self): return \"Woof!\"\n\n# Animal()  # TypeError — abstract class\nDog()       # OK\n```","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Dùng <code>ABC</code> + <code>@abstractmethod</code> để tạo abstract class.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Class con bắt buộc implement tất cả abstract methods, nếu không sẽ không instantiate được.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">python</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"from abc import ABC, abstractmethod\n\nclass Repository(ABC):\n    @abstractmethod\n    async def get_by_id(self, id: int): ...\n\n    @abstractmethod\n    async def create(self, data: dict): ...\n\n    def find_all(self):          # Concrete method — có thể kế thừa\n        return self.get_all()\n\nclass UserRepository(Repository):\n    async def get_by_id(self, id): ...   # Bắt buộc implement\n    async def create(self, data): ...    # Bắt buộc implement\n\n# Repository()  # TypeError — cannot instantiate abstract class\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> abc <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> ABC, abstractmethod\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Repository</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title class_ inherited__\">ABC</span>):\n<span class=\"hljs-meta\">    @abstractmethod</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get_by_id</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">self, <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">id</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">int</span></span>): ...\n\n<span class=\"hljs-meta\">    @abstractmethod</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">create</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">self, data: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">dict</span></span>): ...\n\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">find_all</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">self</span>):          <span class=\"hljs-comment\"># Concrete method — có thể kế thừa</span>\n        <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">self</span>.get_all()\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">UserRepository</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title class_ inherited__\">Repository</span>):\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get_by_id</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">self, <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">id</span></span>): ...   <span class=\"hljs-comment\"># Bắt buộc implement</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">async</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">create</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">self, data</span>): ...    <span class=\"hljs-comment\"># Bắt buộc implement</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># Repository()  # TypeError — cannot instantiate abstract class</span></code></pre></div>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Use ABC + @abstractmethod.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\">Subclasses must implement all abstract methods or they cannot be instantiated.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">python</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"from abc import ABC, abstractmethod\n\nclass Animal(ABC):\n    @abstractmethod\n    def speak(self) -&gt; str: ...\n\nclass Dog(Animal):\n    def speak(self): return &quot;Woof!&quot;\n\n# Animal()  # TypeError — abstract class\nDog()       # OK\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> abc <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> ABC, abstractmethod\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Animal</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title class_ inherited__\">ABC</span>):\n<span class=\"hljs-meta\">    @abstractmethod</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">speak</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">self</span>) -&gt; <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">str</span>: ...\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Dog</span>(<span class=\"hljs-title class_ inherited__\">Animal</span>):\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">speak</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">self</span>): <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Woof!&quot;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\"># Animal()  # TypeError — abstract class</span>\nDog()       <span class=\"hljs-comment\"># OK</span></code></pre></div>","references":[],"related":[{"url":"/q/3115-4-nguyen-ly-oop-trong-python","title":"4 nguyên lý OOP trong Python?"},{"url":"/q/3116-classmethod-vs-staticmethod-vs-instance-method","title":"`@classmethod` vs `@staticmethod` vs instance method?"},{"url":"/q/3117-mro-method-resolution-order-la-gi-python-giai-quyet-diamond-problem-the-nao","title":"MRO (Method Resolution Order) là gì? Python giải quyết diamond problem thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/3118-property-decorator-dung-the-nao","title":"`@property` decorator dùng thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/3120-dataclass-la-gi-loi-ich-so-voi-class-thuong","title":"`@dataclass` là gì? Lợi ích so với class thường?"},{"url":"/q/3121-slots-la-gi-khi-nao-nen-dung","title":"`__slots__` là gì? Khi nào nên dùng?"},{"url":"/q/3122-cac-dunder-methods-quan-trong-nhat-can-biet","title":"Các dunder methods quan trọng nhất cần biết?"},{"url":"/q/3101-python-quan-ly-bo-nho-nhu-the-nao","title":"Python quản lý bộ nhớ như thế nào?"}]}